"macOS doesn't let apps change the usable screen area, so CoolDock moves other apps' windows with Accessibility. Panels, dialogs, minimized and fullscreen windows are left alone." = "macOS 不允许 App 更改屏幕的可用区域，因此 CoolDock 通过辅助功能移动其他 App 的窗口。面板、对话框、已最小化和全屏的窗口不受影响。";
